   "title": {
    "en": "The northern quarantine",
    "es": "La cuarentena del norte",
    "ca": "La quarantena del nord",
    "ru": "Северный карантин"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "An invented fever spread south from the lumber camps. Town by town the province closed its roads, and the quarantine line moved down the coast for three years.\n\nInside the line, mail was smoked and trains ran empty. Outside it, people waited for news.\n\nThis entry is made up for the demo family."
